---
/* The site footer.

   Structure is the client's sheet (`assets/bKash website button
   journey.xlsx`, Sheet1): social links first, then Consumers, Business
   and Company. The columns and their hrefs live in `lib/nav-data.ts`
   beside the header's, so the same label cannot point at two different
   places (audit A7 was a hand-duplicated nav losing a button).

   Nahian, 2026-09-20: the social links sit on the left, as icons, on
   the real bKash accounts. Those four URLs are the only live links on
   this site; everything else is a placeholder route.

   On the homepage the footer also does a job beyond navigation: the
   services section ends pinned, so without something after it there is
   no signal whether you have reached the end of the page or the scroll
   has jammed.
*/
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import { AMAR_SOCIAL, FOOTER_COLUMNS, SOCIAL } from '../lib/nav-data';

const YEAR = new Date().getFullYear();

/* Brand glyphs, inlined: four small marks are not worth a request each,
   and an inline path rides `currentColor`, so each follows the footer's
   own ink on hover. */
